# 🌲 BST (Part 1) - Binary Search Tree Fundamentals

## 📌 Introduction

A **Binary Search Tree (BST)** is a special type of Binary Tree that maintains its nodes in an ordered manner.

For every node:

```text
Left Subtree  <  Root  <  Right Subtree
```

This property makes searching, insertion, and deletion more efficient than in a general Binary Tree when the tree is reasonably balanced.

